+
+The browser half is served from `exports["./client"]`, which points at the
+built `lib/client.js` closure factory (`window.__ModuleLoader__.load({ id:
+"@bench/dsh-bench-sidebar-spur", … })`). `client.js` is the authoring source;
+`npm run build` regenerates the committed bundle — no published preset exposes
+this out-of-tree format, so the build is a dependency-free wrapper script.
 
 Release procedure (internal):
 
